    "text": "The terminal velocity <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><msub><mi>v</mi><mi>t</mi></msub></mfenced></math>&nbsp;of the spherical rain drop depends on the radius <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfenced><mi>r</mi></mfenced></math> of the spherical rain drop as&nbsp;"
  },
